  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First published release (net10.0 only; SharpCoreDB 1.9.3). A master password is required and has no default. Payloads are sealed with AES-256-GCM under a PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 key derived from the password and a per-store salt recorded in servicemq-store.json (store format v1); the row key is authenticated as associated data. The store directory is owned exclusively by one instance via servicemq.lock. GetKeys returns ordinal order; Move flushes the destination before removing the source.",
